# Headless tour of text_input (cargo xtask sim-smoke): tap the name field (the keyboard opens),
# tap "a" and "b" on the on-screen keyboard (the preview follows), tap OK (the keyboard
# closes), then type " Lovelace" on the PC keyboard into the focused field (in two parts: the
# simulated keypad queues at most 16 key events per frame).
wait 300
tap 160 71
wait 300
shot keyboard_open
tap 59 165
wait 100
tap 174 194
wait 300
shot typed_ab
tap 296 223
wait 400
shot keyboard_closed
text " Love"
wait 100
text "lace"
wait 600
shot typed_keypad
